        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARBEL19, Bellagio Paddle Lever with Carre Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bellagio Lever with Carre Plate has a beautiful design that manages to merge old world sensibilities with new world design aesthetics into one stunning leverset with an oversized rose. The Carre Tall Plate is 11 inches tall and 2-1/2 inches wide, making it a great statement piece for larger doors or doors in big spaces, such as rooms with vaulted ceilings. The stepped design of the Carre plate brings a stately air to the paddle lever. The Bellagio Paddle Lever with Carre Tall Plate is available in several classic and contemporary finishes. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/bellagio-keyed-entry-lever-with-carre-tall-plate-grandeur-carbel19entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Bellagio Lever with Carre Tall Plate.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Bellagio Lever with Carre Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bellagio Leverset with Tall Carre Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARBEL19-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262363\" target=\"new\"><b> Grandeur CARBEL19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working levers. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
